node_modules/
.dsh-ops-*.lock
*.log
# One-off patch and probe scripts written while developing; the ones worth keeping
# live in scripts/ and have tests of their own.
.research/
packages/*/node_modules/
# Scratch space the test suites are pointed at (TMPDIR/TMP/TEMP). The directory has
# to exist before a run, so it is created on disk and left behind.
.tmp-test/
# Probe files the harness or an earlier session left behind. They are locked by a
# running process, so they cannot be removed; they must not show up as changes.
.write-probe.txt
scripts/tmp-*.py
# Review units cut out of `git diff` for the bounded-diff-code-review skill. They
# are generated per round from the working tree, so committing them would store a
# snapshot of a diff that no longer exists in the next round.
.review/

